+- `.agents/LOG.md`
+- `.agents/NEXT_TASK.md`
+
+**Build state at end:** `origin/main` unchanged at `3e76114` (nothing pushed from this workspace). Local branch `continuation-100826` carries this traceability commit; patch + checksum stored in the workspace (`/app/memory/patches/`). App fully running locally with seeded demo data; 164/164 API tests green.
+
+**Next best action:** operator reviews the two v3 contracts → approve/amend → C-1 additive schema slice (spec-first) as the first product commit, with the provider sign-out UI gap as a separate optional one-file candidate. Gate B (managed `DATABASE_URL`) remains an external operator-owned step and is NOT claimed here.
